          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            %em Universal spacetimes
            are
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spacetimes"} spacetimes
            for which all
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/conserved+current"} conserved
            symmetric
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tensor"} rank-2 tensors
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/polynomials"} polynomials
            from the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/metric"} metric
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Riemann+tensor"} Riemann tensor
            and its
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/covariant+derivatives"} covariant derivatives
            of arbitrary order, are multiples of the metric. Consequently, metrics of universal spacetimes solve
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vacuum"} vacuum
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equations+of+motion"} equations of motion
            of all
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gravity"} gravitational theories
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/variational+calculus"} extremize
            the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Einstein-Hilbert+action"} Einstein-Hilbert action
            with given
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cosmological+constant"} cosmological constant
            and
            %em arbitrary
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/higher+curvature+correction"} higher curvature correction
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/string+theory"} string theory
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ricci+flat"} Ricci flat
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pp-wave+spacetimes"} pp-wave spacetimes
          %h2#references References
